    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Practice Your Mouse and Keyboard Skills through Games!</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ideal for children aged 3 and up, <strong>Tech Kids Games</strong> offers a fun and interactive way to build confidence and precision with a computer mouse and keyboard.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>50+ engaging mini-games</strong> designed to teach essential PC skills through play. From clicking, dragging, and double-clicking to typing challenges and navigating mazes, every game is tailored to improve fine motor skills and hand-eye coordination.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Features Include:</strong>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of colorful and age-appropriate games for all skill levels.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time stats to track progress and mastery of mouse movements.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kid-friendly interface that\u2019s easy to navigate.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun challenges like popping balloons, typing races, shape matching, and more!  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether your child is just starting their tech journey or looking to sharpen their skills, <strong>Tech Kids Games</strong> is the perfect way to learn through play. Get ready to click, drag, and type your way to success!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Practice Your Mouse and Keyboard Skills through Games!</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ideal for children aged 3 and up, <strong>Tech Kids Games</strong> offers a fun and interactive way to build confidence and precision with a computer mouse and keyboard.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>50+ engaging mini-games</strong> designed to teach essential PC skills through play. From clicking, dragging, and double-clicking to typing challenges and navigating mazes, every game is tailored to improve fine motor skills and hand-eye coordination.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Features Include:</strong>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of colorful and age-appropriate games for all skill levels.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time stats to track progress and mastery of mouse movements.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kid-friendly interface that\u2019s easy to navigate.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun challenges like popping balloons, typing races, shape matching, and more!  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether your child is just starting their tech journey or looking to sharpen their skills, <strong>Tech Kids Games</strong> is the perfect way to learn through play. Get ready to click, drag, and type your way to success!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
